    "description": {
      "content": "The AspenTech Inmation Web API provides HTTP and WebSocket interfaces for external applications to interact with the AspenTech Inmation industrial IoT and time-series data platform. RPC-based REST APIs enable access to process data, system services, and automation functions for manufacturing and energy operations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AspenTech Support",
